teps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Create a story\r\n2. Use addon notes\r\n3. Create a markdown file with this table:\r\n\r\n```\r\n| Attribute    | Type                  |\r\n| ------------ | --------------------- |\r\n| `position`   | `\"left\" \\| \"right\"`   |\r\n```\r\nWhich should render this:\r\n\r\n| Attribute    | Type                  |\r\n| ------------ | --------------------- |\r\n| `position`   | `\"left\" \\| \"right\"`   |\r\n\r\nBut it actually renders like this:\r\n\r\n| Attribute    | Type     |            |\r\n| ------------ | ---------| ---------- |\r\n| `position`   | `\"left\"` | `\"right\"`  |\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nDo not ignore escaped pipes. Do not create new table cells.\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n![table](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/13744542/58240736-e20c8000-7d4b-11e9-9873-2b86fb97ba24.png)\r\n\r\n**System:**\r\n - OS: Windows7\r\n - Browser: Chrome\r\n - Addons: Notes\r\n - Version: 5.0.11","closed_by":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/6869/reactions","total_count":1,